1
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:10,880
(Ms. Chen.)

2
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:12,840
(Come move this table out of the way.)

3
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:14,200
(It's in the way of my dance practice.)

4
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:16,320
Okay. Okay.

5
00:01:02,760 --> 00:01:03,520
Ms. Chen.

6
00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:05,160
Need any help?

7
00:01:06,320 --> 00:01:08,200
Go take care of your pear soup!

8
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:09,760
Always underfoot.

9
00:01:09,920 --> 00:01:12,320
Don't you know Ms. Song Lin
can't stand you?

10
00:01:12,920 --> 00:01:14,320
Why are you still here?

11
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:01,400
Cheers!

12
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,520
(Enjoy yourself.)

13
00:02:12,040 --> 00:02:12,920
(Song Lin.)

14
00:02:12,920 --> 00:02:13,660
=Dear Song=

15
00:02:13,780 --> 00:02:16,900
=Episode 7=
(Every Move Is Calculated)

16
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:18,360
Oh no!

17
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:20,520
It's not working at all!

18
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:22,320
Look at my face!

19
00:02:22,320 --> 00:02:23,720
It's so swollen!

20
00:02:23,760 --> 00:02:25,320
How can I face anyone?

21
00:02:26,440 --> 00:02:27,160
That quack!

22
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:29,320
I'll sue him into bankruptcy!

23
00:02:32,320 --> 00:02:32,880
Yu Song.

24
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:34,400
You're so clever.

25
00:02:34,760 --> 00:02:36,720
You knew Lin had just gotten
a cosmetic injection.

26
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:38,480
Her immune system is at its weakest.

27
00:02:38,480 --> 00:02:39,720
You deserve the credit, Ms. Song Cheng!

28
00:02:39,720 --> 00:02:41,560
You told me she's allergic to mango.

29
00:02:42,920 --> 00:02:43,680
Lin.

30
00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:44,520
Calm down.

31
00:02:44,520 --> 00:02:45,840
I'll take you to the hospital now.

32
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:50,280
Dad...

33
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:50,720
Dad...

34
00:02:52,440 --> 00:02:53,640
This is ridiculous.

35
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:55,520
Why get injections at a time like this?

36
00:02:55,520 --> 00:02:58,440
I didn't know it'd be like this.

37
00:02:59,040 --> 00:02:59,560
Or maybe...

38
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,560
Maybe you could ask Mr. Yu

39
00:03:01,640 --> 00:03:02,960
to delay his visit by a couple of days.

40
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:04,440
Do you think this is a joke?

41
00:03:04,440 --> 00:03:05,000
Then...

42
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:07,520
What about my dance?

43
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:09,240
I practiced all night!

44
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:11,080
With your face all swollen,

45
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:12,520
you still want to dance?

46
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:14,000
Don't you care about Song Group's image?

47
00:03:15,920 --> 00:03:17,120
Stay in your room.

48
00:03:18,040 --> 00:03:19,800
Don't show your face tonight!

49
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:20,920
No way!

50
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:23,360
I practiced this dance just for Mr. Yu.

51
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:25,400
If I don't dance, who can help you?

52
00:03:25,400 --> 00:03:26,120
Are you...

53
00:03:26,200 --> 00:03:27,400
Are you going to give the horse ranch

54
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:29,240
project to that witch Song Huan too?

55
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:29,520
You...

56
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:30,160
Dad.

57
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:31,040
Please calm down.

58
00:03:31,360 --> 00:03:32,000
Don't worry.

59
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:32,920
I'll watch her here.

60
00:03:32,920 --> 00:03:33,840
She won't go anywhere.

61
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:35,520
Think about what you did.

62
00:03:38,720 --> 00:03:39,400
Lin.

63
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:41,920
Ugh!

64
00:03:42,160 --> 00:03:43,720
What am I going to do?

65
00:03:43,720 --> 00:03:44,360
Mr. Song.

66
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:46,600
You're meeting Mr. Yu tonight.

67
00:03:46,600 --> 00:03:47,800
You promised him a surprise.

68
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:49,280
As for Ms. Song Lin...

69
00:03:50,640 --> 00:03:53,160
Song Lin always blames me
for favoring Song Huan

70
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:54,440
and never giving her any work.

71
00:03:54,920 --> 00:03:55,840
But after this...

72
00:03:57,920 --> 00:03:58,760
Well...

73
00:03:59,200 --> 00:04:01,320
What about Ms. Song Cheng?

74
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:06,080
Since Cheng lost the use of her legs,

75
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:07,440
she's barely left home.

76
00:04:07,920 --> 00:04:09,320
She's never been involved in business.

77
00:04:10,840 --> 00:04:12,520
Better not drag her into this.

78
00:04:12,880 --> 00:04:13,600
This matter...

79
00:04:15,320 --> 00:04:16,520
Leave it to Song Huan.

80
00:04:23,440 --> 00:04:24,120
(Come on. Come on.)

81
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:25,360
(This style's kind of cool.)

82
00:04:29,960 --> 00:04:31,120
Eat and drink your fill.

83
00:04:58,520 --> 00:04:59,120
How's everything going?

84
00:04:59,120 --> 00:05:00,040
Are they here yet?

85
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:01,000
Good Lord...

86
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:02,400
Dad said you can't go.

87
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:04,360
Do you really have to go?

88
00:05:04,520 --> 00:05:06,320
Dad finally gave me a chance.

89
00:05:07,080 --> 00:05:08,080
But...

90
00:05:08,640 --> 00:05:09,560
What if...

91
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:11,080
There's no "what if".

92
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:12,960
You useless fool!
What are you afraid of?

93
00:05:13,520 --> 00:05:14,760
Remember how Song Huan

94
00:05:14,760 --> 00:05:17,240
stole the hot spring project from you?

95
00:05:17,760 --> 00:05:18,840
Keep this up,

96
00:05:18,840 --> 00:05:21,000
we'll have nothing left!

97
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:23,840
Go, now!

98
00:05:23,840 --> 00:05:24,640
Fine.

99
00:05:27,960 --> 00:05:29,720
Allow me to introduce our guests.

100
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:32,720
This is Mr. Yu Qixian, president
of the Jinhai Chamber of Commerce.

101
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:36,240
And this is the founder of Yueji Beauty,

102
00:05:36,240 --> 00:05:37,440
Ms. Yu Meng.

103
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:39,840
Also the former owner of this house.

104
00:05:40,960 --> 00:05:41,680
Ms. Yu Meng.

105
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:44,040
Now you're back on the 39th floor.

106
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:45,280
How does it feel?

107
00:05:45,960 --> 00:05:47,680
Hello, everyone. I'm Yu Meng.

108
00:05:48,320 --> 00:05:50,120
Coming back to the 39th floor

109
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:53,040
feels like another lifetime.

110
00:05:53,840 --> 00:05:54,800
This place...

111
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:57,640
once held some unhappy memories for me.

112
00:05:58,680 --> 00:05:59,440
But now,

113
00:05:59,440 --> 00:06:01,920
seeing the Song family
so warm and loving,

114
00:06:02,280 --> 00:06:03,360
I'm truly glad.

115
00:06:03,520 --> 00:06:04,640
This house

116
00:06:04,840 --> 00:06:05,640
has found

117
00:06:05,640 --> 00:06:07,640
the right new owners.

118
00:06:09,880 --> 00:06:11,240
Let me also introduce

119
00:06:11,320 --> 00:06:13,280
my eldest daughter, Song Huan.

120
00:06:13,520 --> 00:06:15,360
She helps me handle

121
00:06:15,520 --> 00:06:16,640
a lot of the group's business.

122
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:19,040
Mr. Yu.

123
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:20,760
I've heard so much about you.

124
00:06:20,960 --> 00:06:21,760
You're too kind.

125
00:06:25,760 --> 00:06:26,680
It's a family dinner.

126
00:06:26,840 --> 00:06:28,040
Please make yourselves at home.

127
00:06:28,640 --> 00:06:29,440
Song.

128
00:06:30,040 --> 00:06:30,920
I heard

129
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:32,960
you're giving me a surprise tonight.

130
00:06:33,440 --> 00:06:34,360
I can't wait to see it.

131
00:06:38,880 --> 00:06:39,560
Come on, Lin.

132
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:40,440
It's your turn.

133
00:06:40,640 --> 00:06:41,160
Okay.

134
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:41,720
Okay.

135
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:44,160
Let's go.

136
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:47,720
The music...

137
00:06:59,800 --> 00:07:00,480
Hurry! Hurry!

138
00:07:53,160 --> 00:07:54,600
(People in Nigang say)

139
00:07:54,960 --> 00:07:57,200
(status is the finest gown.)

140
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:58,680
(In their eyes,)

141
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:00,280
(as long as the skirt is full enough,)

142
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:02,680
(anyone will bow to you.)

143
00:08:09,080 --> 00:08:10,080
How strange.

144
00:08:10,200 --> 00:08:12,840
Wasn't Ms. Song Lin supposed to dance?

145
00:08:13,320 --> 00:08:14,480
Why is it Ms. Song Cheng now?

146
00:08:14,880 --> 00:08:16,640
(I've never seen Ms. Song Cheng before.)

147
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:18,240
(Word was)

148
00:08:18,240 --> 00:08:19,760
(she went fishing with Mr. Song.)

149
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:21,640
(Looks like
the Song family is in for a shake-up.)

150
00:08:23,560 --> 00:08:25,920
Only if she has what it takes.

151
00:08:26,440 --> 00:08:27,320
She'd better not bite off more
than she can chew,

152
00:08:27,320 --> 00:08:28,840
or she'll embarrass the Song family.

153
00:08:54,760 --> 00:08:56,320
The one in the purple suit

154
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:57,840
is Mr. Yu Qixian.

155
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:00,040
Mr. Yu.

156
00:09:00,920 --> 00:09:03,080
Do you like the surprise?

157
00:09:04,640 --> 00:09:05,440
Yes, I do.

158
00:09:14,640 --> 00:09:15,480
Ms. Song Cheng.

159
00:09:16,240 --> 00:09:17,200
May I ask

160
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:20,720
where your pendant came from?

161
00:09:23,440 --> 00:09:24,960
This is a piece I really love

162
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:26,440
by a woodcarver.

163
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:28,520
Sadly,

164
00:09:29,160 --> 00:09:31,360
she passed away from cancer years ago.

165
00:09:32,360 --> 00:09:34,040
People only know he loves dancing.

166
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:37,120
But he loved his late wife most.

167
00:09:37,560 --> 00:09:40,560
This used to be
their favorite piece to play.

168
00:09:42,360 --> 00:09:43,160
While she was alive,

169
00:09:43,160 --> 00:09:46,240
his wife kept a low profile
as a woodcarver.

170
00:09:50,440 --> 00:09:52,440
No wonder you had me wear this

171
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:53,640
instead of pearls.

172
00:09:54,640 --> 00:09:56,240
This is a piece I really love

173
00:09:56,240 --> 00:09:57,840
by a female woodcarver.

174
00:09:58,960 --> 00:09:59,720
Could it be...

175
00:10:00,120 --> 00:10:00,680
Yes.

176
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:02,560
It's one of her early works.

177
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:04,560
To be honest,

178
00:10:06,520 --> 00:10:07,760
the woodcarver you mentioned

179
00:10:08,400 --> 00:10:09,840
was my wife.

180
00:10:11,040 --> 00:10:11,920
She kept a low profile.

181
00:10:12,120 --> 00:10:13,680
No one knew about us.

182
00:10:14,040 --> 00:10:15,960
I've been collecting her works.

183
00:10:16,640 --> 00:10:17,760
I never thought

184
00:10:17,760 --> 00:10:18,960
the last piece I needed

185
00:10:21,520 --> 00:10:22,760
would be with you.

186
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:28,480
I didn't expect that either.

187
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:29,280
Mr. Yu.

188
00:10:29,880 --> 00:10:30,640
So

189
00:10:30,880 --> 00:10:33,080
you have a connection
to our family after all.

190
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:34,920
Cheng.

191
00:10:35,080 --> 00:10:35,880
Okay.

192
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:52,440
Thanks, Ms. Song Cheng.

193
00:10:53,920 --> 00:10:54,720
Mr. Yu.

194
00:10:55,040 --> 00:10:57,320
I enjoy woodworking too.

195
00:10:57,680 --> 00:11:00,360
Your wife was a remarkable artist.

196
00:11:01,640 --> 00:11:02,840
I'm glad it's back

197
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:04,880
where it belongs.

198
00:11:05,360 --> 00:11:06,800
I feel like my wife

199
00:11:07,080 --> 00:11:08,320
somehow brought us together

200
00:11:08,640 --> 00:11:11,120
to work on this project.

201
00:11:11,800 --> 00:11:13,040
About the horse ranch project,

202
00:11:13,040 --> 00:11:14,120
let's discuss it.

203
00:11:15,320 --> 00:11:16,120
That's great.

204
00:11:18,240 --> 00:11:19,840
It seems Ms. Song Cheng and I
were meant to cross paths.

205
00:11:20,520 --> 00:11:21,320
If possible,

206
00:11:21,600 --> 00:11:22,920
I'd like Ms. Song Cheng

207
00:11:23,640 --> 00:11:25,520
to be our point of contact.

208
00:11:32,520 --> 00:11:33,200
Mr. Yu.

209
00:11:33,480 --> 00:11:34,440
My sister

210
00:11:34,440 --> 00:11:36,000
has limited mobility.

211
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:37,840
She's never been involved
in the group's business.

212
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:39,760
I fear she'll slow you down.

213
00:11:39,960 --> 00:11:40,760
My husband...

214
00:11:40,760 --> 00:11:41,960
My husband

215
00:11:41,960 --> 00:11:43,400
has always admired you.

216
00:11:43,400 --> 00:11:44,440
How about...

217
00:11:44,440 --> 00:11:46,120
Though I can't move easily,

218
00:11:46,760 --> 00:11:48,640
I still want to do my part
for the family.

219
00:11:50,520 --> 00:11:52,000
If you don't mind,

220
00:11:52,160 --> 00:11:54,040
I'd love to learn from you.

221
00:11:54,360 --> 00:11:55,040
Is that okay?

222
00:11:55,560 --> 00:11:56,440
Dad.

223
00:11:58,320 --> 00:11:59,200
Mr. Song.

224
00:11:59,920 --> 00:12:01,600
Before I founded Yueji,

225
00:12:01,600 --> 00:12:04,320
my father sheltered me like a flower
in a greenhouse.

226
00:12:04,600 --> 00:12:06,720
But then I realized

227
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:09,760
some storms we must face alone

228
00:12:09,920 --> 00:12:12,120
to grow strong roots and branches.

229
00:12:12,720 --> 00:12:13,640
I believe

230
00:12:13,640 --> 00:12:15,800
Ms. Song Cheng can do it.

231
00:12:16,320 --> 00:12:17,120
Besides,

232
00:12:17,120 --> 00:12:19,200
she has such a remarkable friend.

233
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:28,120
Cheng.

234
00:12:28,600 --> 00:12:30,320
You will lead this project.

235
00:12:30,440 --> 00:12:31,240
Dad!

236
00:12:33,440 --> 00:12:34,520
Work with Mr. Yu.

237
00:12:35,400 --> 00:12:36,040
Dad.

238
00:12:36,040 --> 00:12:38,600
I'm not very familiar with this project.

239
00:12:38,920 --> 00:12:39,920
Could Huan and I

240
00:12:39,920 --> 00:12:41,760
run this project together?

241
00:12:41,760 --> 00:12:42,520
Would that be okay?

242
00:12:52,920 --> 00:12:53,680
Sure.

243
00:12:54,560 --> 00:12:55,320
Mr. Yu.

244
00:12:56,240 --> 00:12:58,040
Here's to a good partnership.

245
00:12:58,320 --> 00:12:59,320
To a good partnership.
